Records explicitly what this does not license. gpt-6-astra is not established
as broken; it answered a repo-reading probe correctly in 9.8 seconds. The
finding is that the conductor's tiers could not complete on it, cause unknown.
A retry needs the planner's exact invocation reproduced outside the conductor
first.

